  "description": "Katie Keith runs a portfolio of plugins that generate over $1M/year in revenue. This video breaks down her multi-product playbook: how she built 20 products and how she allocates resources across them. \n\nGet compliant → https://delve.co/book-demo?utm_source=starterstory&utm_medium=youtube&utm_campaign=primary-feb-08-26\n\nGet our guide to build your $1M Solopreneur MVP: https://clickhubspot.com/rmuv\n\nBuild your own apps → https://build.starterstory.com/?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=katiekeith\n\nFollow Katie: https://x.com/KatieKeithBarn2\nCheck out Barn 2 Plugins: https://barn2.com/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild\n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Intro\n1:52 - Apps Overview and Analytics\n3:40 - Finding the first app idea\n5:16 - Growth multiple products\n6:23 - Make sure your app is compliant (sponsor)\n7:41 - Cross-promotion growth strategy\n9:08 - The multi-product playbook\n11:52 - Tech stack\n13:09 - Final advice\n14:10 - Pat and Gus reflections\n16:33 - Build your first app!!",
